    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent is due, the magpies are hungry, and the only way to get money in this world is to get a job. After convincing your friends to join you, you steal a broken car from the dump, and take a job with the company \u201cRibb-Eats\u201d. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem? <i>You and your friends are frogs.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with up to three other players in this crazy co-op game, where you as frogs, drive a human-sized car to complete deliveries and earn enough to pay your ever-increasing rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703080/extras/08d8fbd4e56c2f754b88111b7ade9a55.avif?t=1747179869\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Benefits of being a frog:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a strong, sticky tongue to grab on to objects within the car.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop around a human-sized space as a tiny frog.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your frog with fun colours and accessories.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Croak like a frog to <span class=\"bb_strike\">annoy </span>communicate with your fellow frogs.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat as many flies as you want during your shifts!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: The Ribb-Eats Company will not be held liable for any frog deaths or disgust that comes from eating flies.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703080/extras/0184b4b6eacd7ce507c7a7e12a4a4405.avif?t=1747179869\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Job Requirements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking up orders from local restaurants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivering orders to houses throughout the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensuring quality customer service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedy Delivery times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protecting orders at all costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paying for City upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers will be expected to know the basics of driving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers should not care about road rules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: The Ribb-Eats Company nor the City will be responsible for hazards on the road, and all damages to your personal vehicle, yourself or upgrades to the roads will be your own person cost.</i>\u00a0<i>Should workers require extra training, this will be begrudgingly given on day one.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703080/extras/cf30ebdb5bd97881f16e541579ab3950.avif?t=1747179869\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are 2-4 workers driving the car, it should be noted that they will be treated as 1 employee and not receive additional benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qualifications:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owns a car.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can deliver orders very quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything else will not receive additional pay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: The</i>\u00a0<i>Ribb-Eats Company does not care who is driving the car, even if it is more than 1 person, as long as the food gets delivered. Ribb-Eats company can not be held liable if road rules are broken.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703080/extras/9eb431036d95b86d3e3f767715905025.avif?t=1747179869\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your shift at Ribb-Eats today! <i>Cause you know there aren't any better option.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent is due, the magpies are hungry, and the only way to get money in this world is to get a job. After convincing your friends to join you, you steal a broken car from the dump, and take a job with the company \u201cRibb-Eats\u201d. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem? <i>You and your friends are frogs.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with up to three other players in this crazy co-op game, where you as frogs, drive a human-sized car to complete deliveries and earn enough to pay your ever-increasing rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703080/extras/08d8fbd4e56c2f754b88111b7ade9a55.avif?t=1747179869\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Benefits of being a frog:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a strong, sticky tongue to grab on to objects within the car.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop around a human-sized space as a tiny frog.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your frog with fun colours and accessories.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Croak like a frog to <span class=\"bb_strike\">annoy </span>communicate with your fellow frogs.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat as many flies as you want during your shifts!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: The Ribb-Eats Company will not be held liable for any frog deaths or disgust that comes from eating flies.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703080/extras/0184b4b6eacd7ce507c7a7e12a4a4405.avif?t=1747179869\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Job Requirements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking up orders from local restaurant